summary.label:
Wake up to daily motivational, life and love quotes with nice background melodies every morning. Morning Quotes isn't ordinary alarm clock application. It's Absolutely new for you!

NOTE: Notifications have to be allowed for alarm to ring.

• If you have trouble waking up in the morning with motivation, you are not alone. Morning Quotes makes waking up motivated.

• This is wisely alarm clock that often encourage everybody to welcome the brand new morning with hope, happiness and enthusiasm. 

• Has beautiful and relax background music.

• Listening to your favorite quotes in the morning can help put you in a good mood, which will then increase your motivation.

• Morning Quotes is the alarm clock application for those who love!

• For those who enjoy life!

• And for those who need motivation!


FEATURES

• 45 alarm quotes to choose from 3 categories - motivational, life and love;
• Wake up to your favorite quote;
• Choose different quotes for every day;
• Listen to quotes by category - motivational, about life and love;
• Go to sleep to your favorite quotes category;
• Simple alarm clock application has been designed for maximum ease of use;
• Beautiful and relax background melodies.
